  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desenvolve SP Program &#x2013; Sustainable Infrastructure</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Desenvolve SP &#x2013; Infraestructuras Sostenibles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es promover el desarrollo sostenible del Estado de S&#xE3;o Paulo (SP). El objetivo espec&#xED;fico es proveer financiamiento de mediano y largo plazo para apoyar el desarrollo de infraestructura e inversiones sostenibles por parte de municipios y MIPYME en el Estado de SP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to promote the sustainable development of the State of S&#xE3;o Paulo (SP). The specific objective is to provide medium and long-term financing to support the development of infrastructure and sustainable investments by municipalities and MSMEs in the State of SP.</narrative>
  </description>
